     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\">Dear Gavin, and all, </span><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\">if I may ask please for your suggestions  on the following :  given an ostesarcoma sample, based on\r\nSDbw Validity index, I shall select the results for the parameter \r\n2_NumClusters (the file is  &quot;chr12.2.numClusters.5.copyNumbers.TITAN.ALL_these_4figures.png&quot;)</span><div><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">However, given this result, I am somehow\r\nunclear, because a predicted DEL (in green) on the LRR plot does not display the typical BAF for a deletion.</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">In\r\n contrast, the prediction for this\r\nchromosome makes more sense shall we select 1_Numclusters (as shown in \r\nthe other file that &#39;ve attached : \r\nchr12.1.numClusters.5.copyNumbers.TITAN.ALL_these_4figures.png); however\r\n it is a higher SDbw Validity index for the run 1_Numclusters.</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">i would appreciate any suggestion regarding\r\non how to interpret the data. Thank you, </span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" color=\"black\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">-- bogdan </span></font></div></span></font></div></div></div>"
